v0.7.2.0

Format: v0.STAGE.RELEASE.FEATURE
  STAGE  = 7 = Ring 3 + proteção de memória + scheduler preemptivo +
                VESA framebuffer 1024x768 32-bit
  RELEASE = 2 = backbuffer VESA (flicker-free), panel + botão [+],
                multi-janela (drag, close, focus), Ctrl+N/Ctrl+Q,
                HEAP 64MB, RAM 512MB
  FEATURE = 0 = initial feature set
